        "identifier": "https://github.com/djalilchafai/ginibre-poincare/tree/fb58b4fd765f19a65c46cb82fb647fb0d94e28ca",
        "note": "Adapted root-multiset and spectral-continuity proofs, polynomial-nullity arguments, and almost-sure simple-spectrum results for the real Gaussian ensemble; original MIT notices retained in source.",
